cons:
The company is implementing out-sourcing strategy;
Only offered 1% annual raise to the "Top Performer";
No oppotunity for promotion and grow, when there is an opening, they hire from external world, so if you are considering joining Santander, make sure you will be happy with the package for at least 3-5 years.

Less payment;
Lack of definition;
Too much work;

advice:
1. Parent needs to stop musical chairs at the CEO level and hire a CEO who has a realistic understanding of the Bank's market position, strengths and weakness' , who in turn will set realistic and achievable goals;
2. Further expand local management at executive level and throughout;
3. Appoint people to run businesses who understand the business and their respective markets- then let them run their businesses;
4. Create a culture and attitude shift where HR supports the needs of the business and management with a focus on retaining quality staff and hiring talent. This includes the need for updated market salary surveys, use of outside recruitment  and a review of short and long term comp.

